<i>I'm right here!</i>

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.880
<i>Just you wait, Manana.</i>

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.700
<i>I'm going to get closer...</i>

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.540
<i>and just like in the game...</i>

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.550
<i>I'll surprise her!</i>

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:48.550
<b>Boo!</b>

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.970
<i>I can't wait to see the 
surprised look on her face!</i>

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.770
Was I just hearing things?

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:00.950
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:04.110
<i>This is a lot harder than I thought!</i>

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.070
<i>Whoa! That looks like it'd 
come up to my waist!</i>

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:10.190
Well, whatever.

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:13.830
<i>Crap! I can't go further like in the game!</i>

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.370
<i>I-I'm going to fall!</i>

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:19.750
<i>If I fall from here, I might not 
get hurt, but I'll be soaked.</i>

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.330
<b>Slosh</b>

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:23.540
<i>And if my bag gets wet, 
my textbooks will get all wrinkly!</i>

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.710
<i>That must not happen!</i>

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:28.630
<i>While I still have a grip, I need to 
give up on moving sideways, and...</i>

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:33.550
<i>Actually, this fence looks 
awkwardly hard to scale...</i>

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.390
<b>Finished</b>

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:41.550
M-Manana...

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.520
<b>Gyaaanana</b>

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>Huh?
What?</b>

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>Could this
be...</b>

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>Heeeeee</b>

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:47.140
C-Could this be... a ghost?!

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>lllllllp</b>

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>Meeee</b>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.440
<b>eeeeee</b>

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.190
What? You wanna curse me?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.590
You hate this world, right?

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.530
I'm not scared of you at all!

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:58.240
The humans working hard 
and sweating in this world

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.910
that you hate so much are the strongest!

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.420
Hey, did I purify it?

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.410
No one cares about that.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.250
Don't tell me...

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.380
Chio-chan!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:18.300
Help! My arms can't...

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.270
W-Wait, Manana! Stop messing around!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:26.560
Say, Chio-chan.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:30.400
Maybe it wouldn't be so bad if you fell. 
You probably won't get hurt.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.280
Huh?!

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:36.570
You were totally trying to play 
a trick on me, weren't you?

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:41.850
If you keep doing crazy things like that, 
you're really going to get hurt someday.

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:45.690
It'll probably do you some 
good to endure a little pain.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:50.380
Don't get me wrong. 
I'm saying this for your sake...

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.090
I'm your best friend, after all.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.300
Why do you have your camera out?!

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.200
<i>You're kidding me!</i>

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:59.180
<i>I totally thought we'd be able to 
reaffirm our friendship like this!</i>

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.380
Hang on!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.180
<b>Grasp</b>

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.440
Chio-chan!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.180
Manana!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.560
Gonna switch over to video 
and add in some HD...

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:02.560
<i>So that's how it's going to be... I see.</i>

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.470
<i>I see how it is, Manana.</i>

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.810
<i>Apparently, I lacked resolve myself.</i>

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:10.610
<i>I'm going to use... my last ounce of strength...</i>

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:12.980
Come on, partner!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:19.810
Let's both descend to hell together!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.960
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.170
Wait, no! Oh, shit! 
Let go! I don't wanna!

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:33.120
Where the hell did all 
that energy come from?!

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:35.590
When I realized that you 
were going to abandon me,

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.510
my body just moved on its own!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:40.180
<i>This bitch is more stubborn than any ghost!</i>

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.860
What the hell are we supposed to do now?!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:44.000
We'll get through it by working together!

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.600
Huh?! Why?!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.300
You did this all on your own, Chio-chan!

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.020
Don't drag me into it!

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:52.820
I bet this is because of 
some game again, isn't it?!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.520
<b>Gulp</b>

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:56.280
You're seriously going to 
get a game over IRL someday!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:59.150
Give me a break! How stupid can you be?!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:02.340
You're not a kid! You're in high school! 
Do you understand that?!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:05.360
Why don't you use your head 
once in a while?! I swear!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.460
Hey, wait...

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:10.400
<i>She's crying?!</i>

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:14.550
Manana...

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:17.120
I'm sorry...

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:24.810
I just wanted to surprise you a little bit...

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:28.850
Okay, fine.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.270
Let's get through this together.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:36.020
So, what do you want me to do?

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:40.570
Um... First, could you take my bag?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.160
Ugh... Come on. Hurry up and hand it over!

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:44.830
Manana!

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:48.250
Okay!

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:50.410
I got your bag! What next?

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.800
Grab my arm!

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:53.330
Like this?

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:57.460
Don't let go, no matter what!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.380
I got it, so stop crying!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.310
Pull as hard as you can!

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.580
Ready, and...

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:21.950
I'm okay now.

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:23.920
I'm saved!

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:25.820
Thank you...

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:28.240
Thank you so much.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:31.910
I guess we can consider your surprise 
somewhat of a success, too.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:34.350
Now we can head to school toge—

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.300
Sorry, I let my guard down...

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:42.260
Manana...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:47.140
I told you that I wouldn't let you go.

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:52.000
Manana... Hurry up and
pull me back, would you?

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.820
Uh, it's taking everything 
I have to hold you up...

00:20:56.820 --> 00:21:00.030
I think my legs have just about had it...

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:03.470
No, no, you're the only one who 
can move right now, Manana.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:04.710
Try harder.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.920
Is that any way to talk to someone 
who just saved your life?!

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:11.280
You haven't saved me yet!

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:14.080
Huh?! I don't mind letting 
go of you, you know!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.730
We're both going to fall 
at this rate! Too bad!

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.750
No! You can fall by yourself!

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:19.670
No way!

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:22.840
You piss me off! I'm so going to let go!

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.600
Please help us!

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.600
<b>Chio's</b>

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.600
School Road

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:34.000
<i>Chio's School Road</i>.

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:39.100
Y-You saved us...

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.520
That was dangerous.

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:43.780
You're students at Samejima Academy, right?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.950
What are your names?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.060
Nono—

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.060
Miya—

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:23.350
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:23.350 --> 00:23:24.790
"Convenience Store Chio-chan,"

00:23:24.790 --> 00:23:29.190
"Chio-chan and the Duel," 
and "Remnants of That Day."

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:30.380
Look forward to it!

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.920
Kushitori-senpai was so fast...

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.220
Maybe I wouldn't mind her 
groping me a little bit...
